{"articleNo":"140698","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=140698&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"Professor position in the Department of Mechanical System Engineering","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.11.18","hit":"2228","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Kumoh National Institute of Technology, Gumi, South Korea.<!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></font></font></span></b></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Professional Assistant Professor, Mechanical Engineering<o:p></o:p></font></font></span></b></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Position Description Summary</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></font></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Job Duties</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></font></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">Kumoh National Institute of Technology (KIT) invites applications for 1 professional-track assistant professor position (non-tenure-track) in mechanical engineering in the Department of Mechanical System Engineering (MSE) beginning spring 2016. The Department of Mechanical System Engineering prepares students to pursue productive careers and advanced degrees in mechanical engineering. The position is a non-tenure-track position at the professional assistant professor level. The successful candidate will teach engineering courses in English and may perform the duties of program coordinator for Center for Convergence-oriented Pro-Mechatronics. </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span style=\"COLOR: red\" lang=\"EN-US\">Apply via email: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"mailto:giman@kumoh.ac.kr\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\">giman@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></b></a><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span style=\"COLOR: red\"> (Prof. Giman Kim, Department Chair)<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">A completed application will include:</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">1. A letter of application addressing qualifications listed above including a statement of teaching philosophy, </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">2. A curriculum vitae, </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">3. Three professional references including name, address, title, telephone number, and email addresses, and</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font color=\"#000000\">4. Copies of transcripts of graduate coursework. Position is open until filled. Review of applications to begin as early as </font><span style=\"COLOR: #0070c0\">December 23, 2016. </span></font></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Qualifications</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></font></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font color=\"#000000\">Candidates must have a Ph. D. in a discipline directly related to engineering, with preference given to candidates with Ph. D. degrees in mechanical engineering. </font><span style=\"COLOR: red\">The official language of application’s country must be English.</span></font></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Preferred Qualifications</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></font></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">Candidates with backgrounds in traditional mechanical engineering disciplines such as thermal / fluids science, mechanical systems, controls and robotics, etc. are preferred, but candidates from all engineering backgrounds will be considered. </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Salary Range <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;</span></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">: 4,100,000 <a name=\"_GoBack\"></a>KRW (3,400~3,600 USD)</span></font></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Pay Basis</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>: Monthly</span></font></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: normal; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Pay Plan</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>: 12-month</span></font></font></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
